<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC Quota compliance committee to meet Monday 130.</title>
<headline>OPEC Quota compliance committee to meet Monday 130.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC's quota compliance committee will meet on Monday at 1300 gmt, an OPEC official said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The committee comprises of the oil minister of Libya, Iran and Nigeria and OPEC Secretary-General Rilwanu Lukman.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2024</p>
